session, where you'll be guided through a series of methods that awaken your body and mind. Alternatively, you can opt for a breathing exercise that helps you center your focus and reduce stress. And if you're short on time, the app also features quick, five-minute routines that can be easily incorporated into your busy morning routine.", "short_description": "With Oyan XR, you can transform your morning routine into a powerful tool for personal growth and self-care. Start your day with intention, focus, and energy, and discover the positive impact that a fulfilling morning ritual can have on your life."}]}, "developer_name": "Khakim Yessenzhanov", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hackstr.github.io/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "black box studio, Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://hackstr.github.io/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["RELAXATION_MEDITATION", "PRODUCTIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "903567277528092"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974738_1414455065744163_2210164120303131027_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wStEW3hkjH0Q7kNvwEKvM3C&_nc_oc=AdrsQxED0lEMEasscKUBQKguYJWRR55xEQJ5PsOKqP9-iwcC1fQ-H9oLA80KpaMZNp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_